  * *note GrMatchingField: GrMatchingField, -- the class of Grassmannian
    matching fields
  * *note grMatchingField: grMatchingField, -- Construct a matching field for
    the Grassmannian variety
  * *note FlMatchingField: FlMatchingField, -- The class of Matching Fields for
    partial flag varieties
  * *note flMatchingField: flMatchingField, -- Construct a matching field for a
