=====================================================

  * "matchingFieldPolytope(...,ExtraZeroRows=>...)" -- see *note
    matchingFieldPolytope: matchingFieldPolytope, -- The polytope of a matching
    field
  * "weightMatrixCone(...,ExtraZeroRows=>...)" -- see *note weightMatrixCone:
    weightMatrixCone, -- The cone of weight matrices that induce the matching
    field

