topeField -- Constructor of a tope field
****************************************

  * Usage: 
        TF = topeField MF
        TF = topeField(MF, T)
  * Inputs:
      * MF, an instance of the type *note GrMatchingField: GrMatchingField,,
        matching field containing the tuples of the tope field
      * T, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the type of the tope field
  * Outputs:
      * TF, an instance of the type *note TopeField: TopeField,, 

Description
===========

The standard constructor of a tope field. If the constructor is supplied with a
matching field and no type, then the type is automatically set to $1,1, \dots,
1$.

